  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "サイコパワーで　かみついて\nあいてを　こうげきする。　ひかりのかべや\nリフレクター　なども　はかいできる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "사이코 파워로 물어서\n상대를 공격한다. 빛의장막이나\n리플렉터도 파괴할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用精神力量咬住對手進行攻擊。\n並可破壞光牆和反射壁等。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur mord la cible avec ses pouvoirs psychiques.\nBrise aussi les barrières comme Mur Lumière\net Protection.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender beißt das Ziel mithilfe von\nPsycho-Kräften. Die Attacke durchbricht auch\nBarrieren wie Lichtschild und Reflektor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca a sus rivales con poderes psíquicos que además\ndestruyen barreras como Pantalla de Luz y Reflejo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Morde il bersaglio con delle zanne generate\ncon l’energia psichica e rompe barriere come\nRiflesso e Schermoluce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user bites the target with its psychic\ncapabilities. This can also destroy Light Screen\nand Reflect.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "サイコパワーで　かみついて\n相手を　攻撃する。　ひかりのかべや\nリフレクター　なども　破壊できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用精神力量咬住对手进行攻击。\n还可以破坏光墙和反射壁等。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca a sus rivales con poderes psíquicos que además\ndestruyen barreras como Pantalla de Luz y Reflejo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
